==English==

===Alternative forms===
* {{alter|en|bejaysus|bejeebus|bejeesus|bejeezus}}

===Etymology===
Reduced form of {{m|en|[[by]] [[Jesus]]}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|en|/bəˈd͡ʒiːzəs/}}
* {{audio|en|LL-Q1860 (eng)-Vealhurl-bejesus.wav|Audio (Southern England)}}
* {{rhymes|en|iːzəs|s=3}}

===Interjection===
{{en-interj}}

# Expressing [[surprise]], [[annoyance]], [[dismay]], or [[anger]].
#* {{quote-book|en|year=1949|author=[[w:James T. Farrell|James T. Farrell]]|title=The Road Between|publisher=Vanguard Press|page=25
|passage=The young stinker and smeller dug in his pocket, pulled something out, and, '''bejesus''', the young stinker and smeller was giving him something.}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|-}}

# {{lb|en|euphemistic}} {{n-g|Used for emphasis, similar to [[crap]], [[shit]] or [[wits]].}}
#: ''The bear scared the '''bejesus''' out of us.''
#: ''He said you confused the '''bejesus''' out of him''
#: ''This old lady just completely slapped the '''bejesus''' out of him.''
#: ''That screaming, flaming skull in the closet totally scared the '''bejesus''' out of me!''
#* {{quote-book|en|year=1949|author=Richard Harrity|title=Hope is the Thing with Feathers|publisher=Dramatists Play Service|page=18
|passage=But they give me clothes for my body, and food for my belly, and tonight, I'm so happy, I could beat the living '''bejesus''' outa this goddam drum.}}
#* '''1972''', [[W:Henry Kissinger|Henry Kissinger]], ''[https://history.state.gov/historicaldocuments/frus1969-76v08/d50 Conversation Between President Nixon and the President’s Assistant for National Security Affairs (Kissinger)]'', [[W:Office of the Historian|Office of the Historian]]:
#*:Nixon: You see what I mean? We can’t take it.
#*:Kissinger: I agree. That’s why we’ve got to blast—
#*:Nixon: That’s right.
#*:Kissinger: —the living '''bejeezus''' out of North Vietnam. We will gain nothing for restraint—.
#*:Nixon: That’s right—
#* '''1995''', [[W:Neal Stephenson|Neal Stephenson]], ''[[W:The Diamond Age|The Diamond Age]]'', [[w:Bantam Books|Bantam Books]]:
#*: Martial arts mean beating the '''bejesus''' out of people.
#* {{quote-journal|en|year=2018|author=[[W:Ignatiy Vishnevetsky|Ignatiy Vishnevetsky]]|title=[https://film.avclub.com/jason-statham-fighting-a-giant-shark-should-be-a-lot-mo-1828161625 Jason Statham fighting a giant shark should be a lot more fun than The Meg]|journal=[[w:The A.V. Club|The A.V. Club]]
|passage=The dorsal fin is one of the animal kingdom’s masterstrokes of branding; it looks like a tooth, and we don’t need to see the rest of the shark to have the '''bejesus''' scared out of us.}}

